Privacy Policy for Sketchbook Studio
Effective date: June 14, 2026
Last updated: June 14, 2026

Sketchbook Studio ("the App," "we," "us," or "our") is a drawing and painting app developed by [Developer Name]. This Privacy Policy explains how the App handles your information. In short: the App works fully offline and does not collect, transmit, or share any personal data.

1. Summary
Sketchbook Studio does not collect, store on our servers, or share any personal information. We have no servers. The App has no internet access and contains no ads, no analytics, and no third-party tracking. Everything you create stays on your device.

2. Information We Collect
None. We do not collect, request, or process any personal data, including:

No name, email address, phone number, or account — the App has no sign-up or login.
No location data.
No contacts, photos library access, camera, or microphone access.
No advertising identifiers.
No usage analytics, crash reporting, or telemetry.
3. How Your Creations Are Stored
All drawings, sketches, and projects you make are saved locally on your device in the App's private storage. We have no access to them. They never leave your device unless you choose to export or share them.

Export: When you export a drawing, it is saved to your device's own Pictures/Sketchbook folder.
Share: When you use the Share function, the image is handed to the other app you select (e.g., messaging, email) through your device. We are not involved in and do not see that transfer.
4. Permissions
The App requests the minimum permissions needed to function:

Storage (Android 9 and older only): Used solely to save your exported drawings to your device's photo gallery. On Android 10 and newer, this is handled by the system and no storage permission is requested.
Motion sensor (accelerometer): Used only for the optional "shake to clear" gesture. This data is processed in real time on your device, is never stored, and is never transmitted.
The App does not request Internet, Location, Camera, Microphone, Contacts, or Phone permissions.

5. Internet and Network
The App has no Internet permission and cannot connect to any network. No data is ever uploaded, downloaded, or transmitted off your device.

6. Third-Party Services
The App contains no third-party software development kits, advertising networks, analytics providers, or social media integrations. No data is shared with any third party.

7. Device Backup
If you have enabled Android's built-in automatic backup, your device's operating system may include the App's data (your saved drawings) in your personal Google account backup. This is a standard Android feature controlled entirely by you and your device settings, governed by Google's Privacy Policy. We do not have access to these backups.

8. Children's Privacy
The App is suitable for all ages. Because it collects no personal information whatsoever, it does not knowingly collect data from children under 13 (or the equivalent minimum age in your jurisdiction) and complies with the U.S. Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) and similar laws.

9. Data Security
Because no data is collected or transmitted, there is no personal data for us to lose or expose. Your creations are stored in the App's private storage area on your device and are protected by your device's own security.

10. Your Rights and Data Deletion
You are always in full control. To permanently delete all data created by the App, simply delete individual sketches within the App, clear the App's storage in your device settings, or uninstall the App. This removes all locally stored data.

11. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted here with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of the App after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.

